  message: "Second outside-reader review, 2026-11-13 (self-run cache f36c63310c791188/results/c872eb7a7e793eab/ac34c56c06ec1788, re-checked on dev fed15705d7, 20 other repositories measured; ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/outside_reader_review2_11142026). NEW EVIDENCE beyond profile.languages. The recorded aardvark_dns crate supplies 25 of the 168 nodes and 25 of the 95 entry points of survey.64k.json, and 28 of the 181 entry points of the full survey. Its three Rust files are the only tracked .rs files with a test attribute, so the 'cargo test' on the sketch Tests line comes from it alone. The main() of recorded/sample_project/pkg/app.py is the sixth CLI entry in the sketch and the crate's main.rs the eleventh. The reader's proposed fix, classify recorded/, is the instance; by the owner's 11-13 ruling the fix has to be a rule that does not name the directory. Sibling filed: WI-lumal-gukuf-hojor-lidot-rodub-zuvom-vupif-vibif (example scripts taking entry-point slots on sqlalchemy, pm2 and express)."  # bff9
